        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "LinkAge Plus: Community activities for over 50’s"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "We are delighted to be celebrating 20 years of LinkAge Plus"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "If you’re over 50 and live in Tower Hamlets, then LinkAge Plus is for you"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "LinkAge Plus is a programme of classes, activities and workshops for people aged 50 and over in Tower Hamlets. It offers friendly, accessible sessions including gentle exercise, social activities, wellbeing workshops and practical support, helping older people stay active, connected and independent. LinkAge Plus sessions take place across five community hubs in the London Borough of Tower Hamlets and is co-funded by Tower Hamlets Council and the North East London Integrated Care Board."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/cropped-cropped-toynebee-6-web-1.jpg",
            "alt": "two women helping each other in a Linkage Plus sewing class",
            "caption": "cropped-cropped-toynebee-6-web-1.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "We run weekly classes and activities"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Whether you want to stay active, try something new, or meet new friends, LinkAge Plus is here to support you. Our sessions help you build skills, boost confidence, keep moving, stay connected, and add structure to your week. Most activities are free or low-cost, including:"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/47-e1765816955936.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "47"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "FITNESS & PHYSICAL ACTIVITY CLASSES"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Including yoga, line dancing, seated exercise, tai chi, english national ballet"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/48-e1765816995120.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "48"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "SOCIAL & LEARNING ACTIVITIES"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Including Bingo, Singing, Darts, Pool, Arts & Crafts"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/49-e1765817038288.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "49"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HEALTHY LIVING WORKSHOPS"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "on topics like diabetes, diet & nutrition, falls prevention"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/50-e1765817086150.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "50"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "IT & DIGITAL SUPPORT SESSIONS"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "For help with computer use, form completion and more"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/51-e1765817159313.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "51"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "CELEBRATIONS & COMMUNITY GATHERINGS"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Including Christmas, Eid gatherings, and other events throughout the year"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.toynbeehall.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/53-e1765817198481.png",
            "alt": "Photograph from Toynbee Hall",
            "caption": "53"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HELP TO ACCESS SUPPORT SERVICES"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "on a wide range of topics including Blue Badges and Benefits Applications"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Join in at one of our five community hubs"
        },
        {
